    " @mentions, review requests, and requested changes from people count as Needs you; ones from bots are FYI. Muted repositories send nothing to the Inbox, and existing items are marked done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : " @mentions, review requests, and requested changes from people count as Needs you; ones from bots are FYI. Muted repositories send nothing to the Inbox, and existing items are marked done."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "人からの@メンション、レビュー依頼、変更要求は「要対応」、ボットからのものは「参考」になります。ミュートしたリポジトリは何も受信トレイに入らず、既存のものも対応済みになります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "真人的 @、请你 review、要求修改算「需要你」，机器人发的算「知悉即可」。静音的仓库什么都不进收件箱，已有的也会处理掉。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    " Failures on the same branch are grouped into one item, reruns included; it's marked done automatically once a run passes, the branch is deleted, or the PR is merged. Automated branches (%@) aren't flagged." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : " Failures on the same branch are grouped into one item, reruns included; it's marked done automatically once a run passes, the branch is deleted, or the PR is merged. Automated branches (%1$@) aren't flagged."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同じブランチの失敗は1件にまとめられ、再実行も同じ件として扱います。その後成功するか、ブランチが削除されるか、PRがマージされると自動的に対応済みになります。自動ブランチ（%1$@）は通知しません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同一个分支的失败合成一件，重跑也算同一件；后来跑成功、分支删了或 PR 合了就自动处理掉。自动分支（%1$@）不提醒。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    " When it continues in the original chat, that chat switches to these settings too." : {
      "comment" : "Appended right after the previous sentence",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : " When it continues in the original chat, that chat switches to these settings too."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "元のチャットで続ける場合、そのチャットもここの設定に切り替わります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接着原来的对话运行时，那段对话也会换成这里的设置。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
