    "A Docker hub updates with a new image: when one is out, run this in the compose file's directory" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Docker hub updates with a new image: when one is out, run this in the compose file's directory"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dockerで動かすハブは新しいイメージで更新します。新しいイメージが出たら、composeファイルのあるディレクトリで次を実行します"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Docker 部署的 hub 由新镜像更新：有新镜像时在 compose 文件所在的目录里运行"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "A SOCKS5 proxy that another app on this device provides, such as a VPN-like client that serves 127.0.0.1 instead of taking the system VPN slot. Persona's traffic to the hub, this device's credential included, goes through it unencrypted, even for an https hub: you're trusting whatever app holds that port." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A SOCKS5 proxy that another app on this device provides, such as a VPN-like client that serves 127.0.0.1 instead of taking the system VPN slot. Persona's traffic to the hub, this device's credential included, goes through it unencrypted, even for an https hub: you're trusting whatever app holds that port."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このデバイス上の別のアプリが提供するSOCKS5プロキシです。たとえば、システムのVPN枠を使わずに127.0.0.1でプロキシを提供するVPN型のクライアントなどです。ハブがhttpsでも、Personaからハブへの通信（このデバイスの認証情報を含む）は暗号化されずにここを通ります。信頼しているのは、そのときこのポートを使っているアプリです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台设备上另一个 App 提供的 SOCKS5 代理，比如在 127.0.0.1 上提供代理、不占用系统 VPN 的客户端。Persona 连 hub 的流量（包括这台设备的凭据）会以明文经过它，即使 hub 用的是 https：你信任的是当时占用这个端口的 App。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bit faster" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A bit faster"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "やや速い"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "快一些"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "A branch and a checkout of its own: the agent changes code there, and this folder stays as it is. [Agent Worktree]" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A branch and a checkout of its own: the agent changes code there, and this folder stays as it is."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "専用のブランチとチェックアウトを作ります。エージェントはそこでコードを変え、このフォルダはそのままです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "给它单独开一个分支和检出：Agent 在那里改代码，这个文件夹不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
