    "A hub is being disconnected. Pair again when it's done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A hub is being disconnected. Pair again when it's done."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ハブを切断しています。完了してから再ペアリングしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在断开 hub，完成后再重新配对。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "A hub you add joins an existing group automatically when it's linked with a hub in it; otherwise it forms its own group. Everything shows in one list, labeled with the group it comes from." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A hub you add joins an existing group automatically when it's linked with a hub in it; otherwise it forms its own group. Everything shows in one list, labeled with the group it comes from."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "追加したハブが既存のハブと連携していれば、自動でそのグループに入ります。連携していない場合は独立したグループになります。一覧ではまとめて表示し、どのグループのものかを示します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加的 hub 和已有的 hub 互联时自动并进那一组；不互联的单独成一组，列表里合在一起显示、标明来自哪一组。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "A key here replaces the provider's key on that computer only. Leave it empty to keep what's there. Keys are stored encrypted on the hub and never sent back." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A key here replaces the provider's key on that computer only. Leave it empty to keep what's there. Keys are stored encrypted on the hub and never sent back."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这里填的 Key 只在那台电脑上替换供应商的 Key，留空保持原样。Key 加密存在 hub 上，不会再发回来。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ここに入れたキーは、そのコンピューターでだけプロバイダーのキーの代わりに使います。空欄なら今のままです。キーはハブに暗号化して保存され、返されることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A meeting's audio, Talk included, goes through your hub to %@, and the hub deletes it once the meeting's minutes are written. The transcript and the minutes are kept as long as your retention settings say." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A meeting's audio, Talk included, goes through your hub to %1$@, and the hub deletes it once the meeting's minutes are written. The transcript and the minutes are kept as long as your retention settings say."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会议的音频（包括“说话”）会经你的 hub 发送到 %1$@，会议纪要写好后 hub 就删除它。文字稿和会议纪要按你的保留设置保存。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会議の音声は（「話す」を含め）ハブを経由して %1$@ に送られ、議事録ができるとハブが削除します。文字起こしと議事録は保存期間の設定どおりに保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A meeting's audio, Talk included, goes through your hub to the speech service it is set up with, and the hub deletes it once the meeting's minutes are written. The transcript and the minutes are kept as long as your retention settings say." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A meeting's audio, Talk included, goes through your hub to the speech service it is set up with, and the hub deletes it once the meeting's minutes are written. The transcript and the minutes are kept as long as your retention settings say."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会议的音频（包括“说话”）会经你的 hub 发送到它配置的语音服务，会议纪要写好后 hub 就删除它。文字稿和会议纪要按你的保留设置保存。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会議の音声は（「話す」を含め）ハブを経由して、ハブに設定された音声サービスに送られ、議事録ができるとハブが削除します。文字起こしと議事録は保存期間の設定どおりに保存されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
