      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "After a reply in a chat you have open, a small model suggests what you might send next, above the empty message box. Claude Code in a terminal keeps its own suggestions. Uses one extra model call per reply; the model is set under Model configuration › Next-message suggestions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After a reply in a chat you have open, a small model suggests what you might send next, above the empty message box. Claude Code in a terminal keeps its own suggestions. Uses one extra model call per reply; the model is set under Model configuration › Next-message suggestions."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開いているチャットで返信のたびに、小さなモデルが次に送りそうなメッセージを空の入力欄の上に提案します。ターミナルの Claude Code は自身の提案を使い続けます。返信ごとにモデル呼び出しが1回増えます。使うモデルは「モデル設定 › 次のメッセージの候補」で設定します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你打开的对话里，每次回复后由小模型在空输入框上方建议你可能要发的下一句。终端里的 Claude Code 仍用它自己的建议。每次回复多一次模型调用；所用模型在「模型配置 › 下一句建议」里设置。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "After an upstream refusal, this conversation answers with %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After an upstream refusal, this conversation answers with %1$@."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上流で拒否されたため、この会話は %1$@ で応答しています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上游拒绝了一次请求，这个对话现在用 %1$@ 回复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After an upstream refusal, this session switched to a fallback model" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After an upstream refusal, this session switched to a fallback model"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上流で拒否されたため、このセッションはフォールバックモデルに切り替わりました"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上游拒绝后，这个会话改用了回退模型"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After disconnecting, you'll need to scan the code to pair again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After disconnecting, you'll need to scan the code to pair again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "切断後は、コードをスキャンして再度ペアリングする必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "断开后需要重新扫码配对。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "After finishing, Persona waits %@ and skips the notification if you've already looked on your computer or in the app. It notifies once, after background tasks and subagents are all done. A “long task” is a turn that ran %@ or longer; quick answers are best read where you asked." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "做完后等 %1$@，这期间在电脑上或 App 里看过就不推；后台任务、子 Agent 都结束后才推一次。「长任务」指干了 %2$@以上的那一轮，秒回的问题在哪问的就在哪看。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After finishing, Persona waits %1$@ and skips the notification if you've already looked on your computer or in the app. It notifies once, after background tasks and subagents are all done. A “long task” is a turn that ran %2$@ or longer; quick answers are best read where you asked."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完了後%1$@待ち、その間にコンピューターやAppで確認していれば通知しません。バックグラウンドタスクやサブエージェントがすべて終わってから1回だけ通知します。「長いタスク」とは%2$@以上かかったターンのことで、すぐ返る質問は尋ねた場所で確認できます。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "After installing, come back here to bind it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "After installing, come back here to bind it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "インストール後、ここに戻って紐づけてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "装好以后回到这里绑定。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "After the Meeting" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
