    "Both avatars use the default Home Screen icon. Older alternate icons reset to the default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Both avatars use the default Home Screen icon. Older alternate icons reset to the default."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どちらもデフォルトのホーム画面アイコンを使います。古い代替アイコンはデフォルトに戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两种形象都使用默认桌面图标。旧的备用图标会切回默认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both off by default. While the first is off, the background supervisor follows up the tasks Persona hands out, so the main chat answers you first. The second also follows up Agents started outside the main chat, and uses extra model calls." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Both off by default. While the first is off, the background supervisor follows up the tasks Persona hands out, so the main chat answers you first. The second also follows up Agents started outside the main chat, and uses extra model calls."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どちらも既定でオフです。1 つ目がオフのあいだは、Persona が任せたタスクをバックグラウンド監督がフォローし、メインチャットはあなたへの返信を優先します。2 つ目はメインチャット以外から開始したエージェントもフォローし、モデルの呼び出しが増えます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两项默认都关闭。第一项关着时，Persona 派出的任务由后台督办跟进，主对话优先回复你。第二项让不是从主对话派出的 Agent 也有人跟进，会多花一些模型调用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Both versions have the same text; the change may be in formatting, images, or layout. Open each one with the buttons below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Both versions have the same text; the change may be in formatting, images, or layout. Open each one with the buttons below."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "2つのバージョンのテキストは同じです。書式、画像、レイアウトが変更された可能性があります。下のボタンでそれぞれ開いて確認してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两个版本的文字一样，改的可能是格式、图片或版式：用下面的按钮分别打开看"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
