            "value" : "已收起改动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes take effect from the next run. Current tasks aren't interrupted and past data isn't reprocessed. Permission settings don't change with the model." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Changes take effect from the next run. Current tasks aren't interrupted and past data isn't reprocessed. Permission settings don't change with the model."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存後は次回の実行から反映されます。実行中のタスクは中断されず、過去のデータも再処理されません。権限設定はモデルによって変わりません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存后从下一次运行生效，不会打断当前任务，也不会重新处理历史数据。权限设置不会随模型改变。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Changes the extension ID from %@ to %@. Needs your confirmation; its settings and data stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Changes the extension ID from %@ to %@. Needs your confirmation; its settings and data stay."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "拡張機能の ID が %1$@ から %2$@ に変わります。確認が必要です。設定とデータはそのまま保持されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扩展 ID 会从 %1$@ 改为 %2$@，需要你确认；设置和数据保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Changes to Needs you, Working, and Done update right away; numbers like tokens and load update at most once a minute (the system limits Live Activity pushes), and in real time while you're in the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Changes to Needs you, Working, and Done update right away; numbers like tokens and load update at most once a minute (the system limits Live Activity pushes), and in real time while you're in the app."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要対応・作業中・完了の変化はすぐに更新されます。トークンや負荷などの数値は最大1分に1回の更新です（システムがライブアクティビティのプッシュ回数を制限しているため）。アプリ内ではリアルタイムに更新されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要你、在工作、做完了的变化立刻更新；token、负载这些数字最多每分钟更新一次（系统限制实时活动的推送次数），在 App 里时实时更新。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Changing a category applies to every use in it. Takes effect from the next run without interrupting current tasks." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Changing a category applies to every use in it. Takes effect from the next run without interrupting current tasks."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カテゴリを変更すると、そのカテゴリのすべての用途に適用されます。次回の実行から反映され、実行中のタスクは中断されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "修改一个分类，将统一用于该分类的所有用途；从下一次运行生效，不打断当前任务。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
