    "Click an agent in the list on the left to open its chat here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click an agent in the list on the left to open its chat here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "左のリストでエージェントをクリックすると、ここにチャットが開きます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "左边列表里点一个 Agent，对话会在这里打开。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Click for the left mouse button; right-click (or Control-click) for the right button; press and hold the mouse button and move to drag." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click for the left mouse button; right-click (or Control-click) for the right button; press and hold the mouse button and move to drag."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "クリックで左クリック、右クリック（またはControlを押しながらクリック）で右クリック、マウスボタンを押したまま動かすとドラッグになります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点按就是左键；右键点按（或按住 Control 再点按）是右键；按住鼠标键不放再移动就是拖拽。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Click the terminal to type directly: every key goes to the terminal (input methods work too), and ⌘ shortcuts stay with the app. The key bar's keyboard button moves input to or away from the terminal; double-click it for Return. A click on the terminal is also a click inside it (such as Claude's “Jump to bottom”)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click the terminal to type directly: every key goes to the terminal (input methods work too), and ⌘ shortcuts stay with the app. The key bar's keyboard button moves input to or away from the terminal; double-click it for Return. A click on the terminal is also a click inside it (such as Claude's “Jump to bottom”)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ターミナルをクリックすると直接入力でき、すべてのキーがターミナルに送られます（入力方式も使えます）。⌘のショートカットはAppが使います。キーバーのキーボードボタンで入力先をターミナルに切り替え、ダブルクリックでReturnです。ターミナルのクリックはターミナル内のクリックにもなります（Claudeの「Jump to bottom」など）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点一下终端就能直接打字，每个键发到终端（输入法也能用），⌘ 组合键留给 App；键栏的键盘按钮把输入移到终端或移开，双击它是回车。点终端同时是点在终端里（比如 Claude 的「Jump to bottom」）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Click the terminal: start typing; the click also goes to the terminal (Claude's “Jump to bottom”, questions at the top)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Click the terminal: start typing; the click also goes to the terminal (Claude's “Jump to bottom”, questions at the top)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ターミナルをクリック：入力を開始し、ターミナル内のクリックにもなります（Claudeの「Jump to bottom」や上部の質問）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点终端：开始打字，也是点在终端里（Claude 的「Jump to bottom」、顶上的提问）"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
