    "Credentials are stored encrypted on the hub and only given to this channel. You may need to pair once afterward; whoever pairs becomes this channel's owner." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Credentials are stored encrypted on the hub and only given to this channel. You may need to pair once afterward; whoever pairs becomes this channel's owner."
