    "Decisions made on this to-do go here. Your answers to an agent's questions are recorded automatically, and so are the outcome, decisions and pitfalls when a task is finished; you can add your own. The current ones go along when you hand it to an agent." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Decisions made on this to-do go here. Your answers to an agent's questions are recorded automatically, and so are the outcome, decisions and pitfalls when a task is finished; you can add your own. The current ones go along when you hand it to an agent."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このToDoで決めたことをここに記録します。エージェントの質問への回答は自動で記録され、タスクが完了すると結論・決めたこと・つまずいた点も記録されます。手動でも追加できます。エージェントに任せるときは有効なものが一緒に送られます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这件事上拍过的板记在这里：Agent 提问时你的回答会自动记一条，任务做完时会记下结论、做过的决定和踩过的坑，也可以手动记。交给 Agent 时会带上生效的这些。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
