    "During these hours you're not told when an agent finishes (the morning's Today card sums it up), and things that need you arrive without a sound. Reminders you asked the assistant for still come as usual. A chat bot's nudges about unanswered cards also wait while any of your devices is in its quiet hours. In this device's time zone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "During these hours you're not told when an agent finishes (the morning's Today card sums it up), and things that need you arrive without a sound. Reminders you asked the assistant for still come as usual. A chat bot's nudges about unanswered cards also wait while any of your devices is in its quiet hours. In this device's time zone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这段时间里，Agent 做完不再通知（早上的「今天要知道的」卡片会汇总），需要你的事照常送达但不响铃。你让助手设的提醒照常提醒。只要你有一台设备在免打扰时段内，聊天机器人对未回答卡片的提醒也会顺延。按这台设备的时区计算。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この時間帯は、エージェントの完了は通知しません（朝の「今日の確認事項」カードにまとまります）。対応が必要なものは音を鳴らさずに届きます。アシスタントに頼んだリマインダーはいつもどおり届きます。いずれかのデバイスがおやすみ時間の間は、チャットボットからの未回答カードのお知らせも後回しにします。このデバイスのタイムゾーンで判断します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During these hours you're not told when an agent finishes (the morning's Today card sums it up), and things that need you arrive without a sound. Reminders you asked the assistant for still come as usual. A chat bot's nudges about unanswered cards also wait while any of your devices is in its quiet hours. They're in %@, where they were set; changing them here puts them in this device's time zone." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "During these hours you're not told when an agent finishes (the morning's Today card sums it up), and things that need you arrive without a sound. Reminders you asked the assistant for still come as usual. A chat bot's nudges about unanswered cards also wait while any of your devices is in its quiet hours. They're in %@, where they were set; changing them here puts them in this device's time zone."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这段时间里，Agent 做完不再通知（早上的「今天要知道的」卡片会汇总），需要你的事照常送达但不响铃。你让助手设的提醒照常提醒。只要你有一台设备在免打扰时段内，聊天机器人对未回答卡片的提醒也会顺延。目前按设置时所在的 %@ 计算，在这里改动后改按这台设备的时区计算。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この時間帯は、エージェントの完了は通知しません（朝の「今日の確認事項」カードにまとまります）。対応が必要なものは音を鳴らさずに届きます。アシスタントに頼んだリマインダーはいつもどおり届きます。いずれかのデバイスがおやすみ時間の間は、チャットボットからの未回答カードのお知らせも後回しにします。現在は設定した場所の %@ で判断します。ここで変更すると、このデバイスのタイムゾーンで判断します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
