        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "列表里每个 Agent 的行写明它在等什么"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each assistant is complete on its own, with its own chats, inbox and computers, running wherever you choose." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each assistant is complete on its own, with its own chats, inbox and computers, running wherever you choose."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各アシスタントはそれぞれ独立していて、自分のチャット、受信トレイ、コンピュータを持ち、どこで動かすかはあなたが決めます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个助手都是完整独立的，有自己的对话、收件箱和电脑，跑在哪由你定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each chat runs Claude in the background in this directory on %@, outside herdr. Choose the model in Settings › Models › Main Chat; change it for a single chat from that chat's menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each chat runs Claude in the background in this directory on %1$@, outside herdr. Choose the model in Settings › Models › Main Chat; change it for a single chat from that chat's menu."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各チャットは%1$@のこのディレクトリでClaudeをバックグラウンド実行します（herdrは使いません）。モデルは「設定 › モデル設定 › メインチャット」で選び、個別のチャットはそのチャットのメニューで変更できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每段对话在 %1$@ 的这个目录里后台运行一个 Claude，不进 herdr。用哪个模型在「设置 › 模型配置 › 主对话」里选，单段对话在它自己的菜单里换。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Each computer fetches the key as soon as it connects, so it still starts while the hub can't be reached. Off: a computer fetches it the first time it needs it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each computer fetches the key as soon as it connects, so it still starts while the hub can't be reached. Off: a computer fetches it the first time it needs it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电脑一连上就取 Key，hub 连不上时也照样能启动。关掉：电脑第一次用到时才取。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接続した時点でキーを取得するので、ハブに届かないときも起動できます。オフ：初めて必要になったときに取得します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each device has its own credentials. If you lose one, revoke just that one; the others keep working. A watch can only view and answer; it can't change settings or start and stop agents." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each device has its own credentials. If you lose one, revoke just that one; the others keep working. A watch can only view and answer; it can't change settings or start and stop agents."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "デバイスごとに個別の認証情報があります。紛失したデバイスだけを取り消せば、ほかのデバイスには影響しません。Apple Watchは表示と回答のみで、設定の変更やエージェントの起動・停止はできません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每台设备有自己的凭据，丢了哪台就撤销哪台，其他设备不受影响。手表只能看和回答，不能改设置、开关 Agent。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Each meeting recording starts with this. To change it for one meeting, pick another on the Recordings page before you start." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each meeting recording starts with this. To change it for one meeting, pick another on the Recordings page before you start."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会議の録音はこの設定で始まります。1 回だけ変えるときは、開始前に「録音」ページで選び直します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次会议录音都按这里开始。只想改一场，开始前在「录音」页上另选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each run goes into the chat that scheduled it and continues with its context." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each run goes into the chat that scheduled it and continues with its context."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毎回、予約したチャットに送られ、そこでの文脈を引き継いで続けます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次运行都发进安排它的那段对话，带着那里的上下文接着做。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Each run goes into this task's own chat and can see earlier results. When it gets too long or you want a fresh start, tap “New Chat Next Time”; the old chat stays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Each run goes into this task's own chat and can see earlier results. When it gets too long or you want a fresh start, tap “New Chat Next Time”; the old chat stays."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "毎回このタスク専用のチャットに送られ、前回までの結果を参照できます。長くなりすぎたときややり直したいときは「次回は新しいチャット」をタップします。元のチャットは残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每次运行都发进这个任务自己的对话，能看到前几次的结果。对话太长或想重来时，点「下次开新对话」，原来的对话还在。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
