          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every message is stored. Leave the days empty to keep them as long as the deciding rule or the hub's text retention says." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every message is stored. Leave the days empty to keep them as long as the deciding rule or the hub's text retention says."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "すべてのメッセージを保存します。日数を空欄にすると、適用されるルールまたはハブのテキスト保持期間に従います。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "保存每条消息。天数留空时，按决定它的规则或 hub 的文本保留期保存。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every pane in the tab closes, and the agents running in them end too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every pane in the tab closes, and the agents running in them end too."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "タブ内のすべてのペインが閉じ、その中で実行中のエージェントも終了します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标签页里的所有窗格都会关掉，里面运行的 Agent 也会结束。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Every pane in “%@” is running an agent. Open a new terminal tab and run it there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every pane in “%1$@” is running an agent. Open a new terminal tab and run it there."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%1$@」のペインはすべてエージェントを実行中です。新しいターミナルタブを開いて、そこで実行してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%1$@」里的窗格都在运行 Agent。新开一个终端标签页，在那里运行。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Every run of a scheduled task or follow-up, including failed and skipped ones, is listed here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every run of a scheduled task or follow-up, including failed and skipped ones, is listed here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "定期タスクとフォローアップの実行は、失敗やスキップも含めてすべてここに記録されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "定时任务和跟进每跑一次（包括失败和跳过的）都记在这里。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Every signed-in account goes into the Inbox, and you can switch accounts on the Messages page. /agent, the Assistant and Knowledge use the default account. Add or sign out of accounts in the Lark gateway." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every signed-in account goes into the Inbox, and you can switch accounts on the Messages page. /agent, the Assistant and Knowledge use the default account. Add or sign out of accounts in the Lark gateway."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ログイン済みのアカウントはすべて受信トレイに入り、「メッセージ」ページでアカウントを切り替えられます。/agent、アシスタント、ナレッジはデフォルトのアカウントを使います。アカウントの追加やログアウトはLarkゲートウェイで行います。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已登录的账号都会收进收件箱，「消息」页可以切换账号。/agent、助手和知识库使用默认账号；在飞书网关里添加或退出账号。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Every to-do has a due date" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Every to-do has a due date"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
