    "For a hub published through Cloudflare Access: the app sends this service token with every request to %@, and only there. It's kept with this hub's pairing in the keychain." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For a hub published through Cloudflare Access: the app sends this service token with every request to %1$@, and only there. It's kept with this hub's pairing in the keychain."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cloudflare Access 経由で公開しているハブ用です。アプリは %1$@ へのすべてのリクエストにこのサービストークンを付け、ほかには送りません。このハブのペアリングと一緒にキーチェーンに保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用于通过 Cloudflare Access 发布的 hub：App 发往 %1$@ 的每个请求都带上这个服务令牌，不会发到别处。它和这台 hub 的配对一起保存在钥匙串里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For a provider with the same gateway and key, only the models are merged; other settings stay the same." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For a provider with the same gateway and key, only the models are merged; other settings stay the same."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "同じゲートウェイとKeyのプロバイダーがある場合はモデルのみ統合し、その他の設定は変わりません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已有同样网关和 Key 的供应商只合并模型，其他设置不变。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "For a terminal session, type /model in Claude Code yourself; it may also change the default model for new sessions." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For a terminal session, type /model in Claude Code yourself; it may also change the default model for new sessions."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ターミナルのセッションでは、Claude Code で /model を自分で入力してください。新しいセッションの既定モデルも変わることがあります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "终端里的会话请在 Claude Code 里自己输入 /model 换模型；它可能同时改掉新会话的默认模型。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For example Ovis or another herdr client. Taking over disconnects it and resizes the terminal to the iPhone; when you leave the terminal, the pane returns to the computer's size." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For example Ovis or another herdr client. Taking over disconnects it and resizes the terminal to the iPhone; when you leave the terminal, the pane returns to the computer's size."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "たとえばOvisや別のherdrクライアントです。引き継ぐとそちらは切断され、ターミナルはiPhoneのサイズになります。ターミナルを離れると、ペインはコンピューターのサイズに戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比如 Ovis 或另一个 herdr 客户端。接管后它会断开，终端改成手机的尺寸；离开终端时窗格回到电脑上的尺寸。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "For example Ovis or another herdr client. Taking over disconnects it and resizes the terminal to this window; when you leave the terminal, the pane returns to the computer's size." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For example Ovis or another herdr client. Taking over disconnects it and resizes the terminal to this window; when you leave the terminal, the pane returns to the computer's size."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "たとえばOvisや別のherdrクライアントです。引き継ぐとそちらは切断され、ターミナルはこのウインドウのサイズになります。ターミナルを離れると、ペインはコンピューターのサイズに戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比如 Ovis 或另一个 herdr 客户端。接管后它会断开，终端改成这个窗口的尺寸；离开终端时窗格回到电脑上的尺寸。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "For example: Work" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For example: Work"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "例：仕事"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "比如：工作"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "For this iPhone only. With it on, a meeting transcribed on the hub sends no audio over cellular data: this iPhone transcribes it meanwhile, and the audio goes to the hub once you're on Wi-Fi. An hour of meeting is about 115 MB." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "For this iPhone only. With it on, a meeting transcribed on the hub sends no audio over cellular data: this iPhone transcribes it meanwhile, and the audio goes to the hub once you're on Wi-Fi. An hour of meeting is about 115 MB."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只对这台 iPhone 生效。打开后，在 hub 上转写的会议不会用蜂窝数据发送音频：这期间由这台 iPhone 转写，连上 Wi-Fi 后再把音频发给 hub。一小时的会议大约 115 MB。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この iPhone だけの設定です。オンにすると、ハブで文字起こしする会議はモバイルデータ通信で音声を送りません。その間はこの iPhone が文字起こしし、Wi-Fi につながったら音声をハブに送ります。1時間の会議で約 115 MB です。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
