    "Functions and aliases in each computer's login shell config (~/.zshrc, ~/.bashrc) that call claude or codex. They sync each time you open this page, and new ones show up automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Functions and aliases in each computer's login shell config (~/.zshrc, ~/.bashrc) that call claude or codex. They sync each time you open this page, and new ones show up automatically."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各コンピューターのログインシェルの設定ファイル（~/.zshrc、~/.bashrc）にある、claude / codexを呼び出す関数とエイリアスです。このページを開くたびに同期され、追加したものは自動で表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "各台电脑登录 shell 的配置文件（~/.zshrc、~/.bashrc）里调用 claude / codex 的函数和别名，每次打开这页时同步；新加的会自动出现。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Functions in ~/.zshrc and wrapper scripts on PATH that start claude, on your computers. They sync each time you open this page, and new ones show up automatically." : {
