    "GitHub markets: a private repo needs a read-only token (read access to this repo's Contents). A token helps a public repo too: it raises the limit from 60 reads an hour (shared by your whole network) to 5,000. Choose Public repositories with no permissions. It's stored encrypted on the hub, sent only to the market itself, and not shown again once saved. git: markets use the hub machine's SSH credentials and don't need one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GitHub markets: a private repo needs a read-only token (read access to this repo's Contents). A token helps a public repo too: it raises the limit from 60 reads an hour (shared by your whole network) to 5,000. Choose Public repositories with no permissions. It's stored encrypted on the hub, sent only to the market itself, and not shown again once saved. git: markets use the hub machine's SSH credentials and don't need one."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GitHubマーケット：プライベートリポジトリには読み取り専用トークンが必要です（このリポジトリのContentsの読み取り権限）。公開リポジトリでもトークンは役立ち、読み取りの上限が1時間あたり60回（ネットワーク全体で共有）から5,000回に上がります。Public repositoriesを選び、権限は付けなくてかまいません。暗号化してハブに保存され、マーケット自身にのみ送られ、保存後は表示されません。git:マーケットはハブのマシンのSSH認証情報を使うので不要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GitHub 市场：私有仓库要一个只读 token（这个仓库的 Contents 读权限）；公开仓库填一个也有用，读的额度从每小时 60 次（整个网络共用）提到 5000 次，选 Public repositories、不勾权限就行。加密存在 hub 上，只发给市场自己，存好后不再显示。git: 市场用 hub 机器的 SSH 凭据，不用填。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
