    },
    "If macOS asks to quit and reopen Cua Driver, or whether it may access the screen directly, choose Allow" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If macOS asks to quit and reopen Cua Driver, or whether it may access the screen directly, choose Allow"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cua Driverの終了と再起動を求められたり、画面への直接アクセスを尋ねられたりしたら、いずれも許可を選びます"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统要是提示退出并重新打开 Cua Driver，或问它能否直接访问屏幕，都选允许"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "If not" : {
      "comment" : "The context the assistant filled in on a question: what not taking its recommendation costs",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If not"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選ばない場合"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不选的代价"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "If the chat hasn't been compacted, only the last few messages come along. For a full summary, compact the context first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If the chat hasn't been compacted, only the last few messages come along. For a full summary, compact the context first."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "圧縮していない場合は直近の数件だけを引き継ぎます。完全な要約を引き継ぐには、先にコンテキストを圧縮してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没压缩过的只带最近几条；想带完整摘要，可以先压缩上下文。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "If this device can't reach the hub's address (different network, no VPN), you can go through an SSH server that can reach the hub." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If this device can't reach the hub's address (different network, no VPN), you can go through an SSH server that can reach the hub."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このデバイスからハブのアドレスに届かない場合（別のネットワーク、VPN未接続など）は、ハブにアクセスできるSSHサーバーを経由できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台设备访问不到 hub 的地址时（不在同一个网络、没开 VPN），可以经一台能访问 hub 的 SSH 服务器转过去。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "If you close it, the changes you made won't be saved." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you close it, the changes you made won't be saved."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "閉じると、今回の変更は保存されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关掉后，这次改的内容不会保存。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "If you use the terminal on the hub's machine: run this line there and it prints a QR code and a pairing link." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you use the terminal on the hub's machine: run this line there and it prints a QR code and a pairing link."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "hub のマシンでターミナルを使う場合：そのマシンでこの行を実行すると、QR コードとペアリングリンクが表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会用 hub 所在机器的终端的话：在那台机器上运行这一行，它会打印二维码和配对链接。"
          }
        }
      },
