    "In Mouse Mode, pinch to zoom in and out; when zoomed in, dragging with two fingers moves the view instead of scrolling. In either mode, “…” › Zoom In zooms in around the pointer and Zoom to Fit shows the whole screen again. In Trackpad Mode two fingers only scroll, and a zoomed view follows the pointer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Mouse Mode, pinch to zoom in and out; when zoomed in, dragging with two fingers moves the view instead of scrolling. In either mode, “…” › Zoom In zooms in around the pointer and Zoom to Fit shows the whole screen again. In Trackpad Mode two fingers only scroll, and a zoomed view follows the pointer."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "マウスモードではピンチで拡大・縮小します。拡大中は、2本指のドラッグでスクロールではなく画面を移動します。どちらのモードでも「…」›「拡大」でポインタを中心に拡大し、「画面に合わせる」で画面全体の表示に戻ります。トラックパッドモードでは2本指はスクロールだけで、拡大中の画面はポインタに合わせて動きます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "鼠标模式下双指开合放大、缩小；放大以后，两指拖动是移动画面，不再滚动。两种模式都可以用「…」›「放大」以指针为中心放大，「还原」回到整个屏幕。触控板模式下两指只滚动，放大后画面跟着指针走。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
