    "In the first-run setup, choose to import data from Chrome (or another browser): your site sign-ins come along. macOS asks for the keychain password several times; enter that Mac's login password each time. You can skip importing" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the first-run setup, choose to import data from Chrome (or another browser): your site sign-ins come along. macOS asks for the keychain password several times; enter that Mac's login password each time. You can skip importing"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "初期設定でChrome（または他のブラウザ）からデータをインポートすると、サイトのログイン状態も引き継がれます。macOSがキーチェーンのパスワードを何度か求めるので、毎回そのMacのログインパスワードを入力してください。インポートしない場合はスキップできます"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "首次设置里选从 Chrome（或别的浏览器）导入数据：网站的登录状态会一起带过来。macOS 会多次要钥匙串密码，每次都输那台 Mac 的登录密码。不想导入可以跳过"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "In the key bar's bolt: click to type, double-click to run with Return. Right-click a command to move it up, move it down, or delete it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the key bar's bolt: click to type, double-click to run with Return. Right-click a command to move it up, move it down, or delete it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "キーバーの稲妻から：クリックで入力、ダブルクリックでReturn付きで実行。右クリックで上へ移動、下へ移動、削除ができます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在键栏的闪电里：单击输入，双击带回车执行。右键一条可以上移、下移或删除。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "In the key bar's bolt: tap to type, double-tap to run with Return. Tap Edit at the top left to delete or reorder." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In the key bar's bolt: tap to type, double-tap to run with Return. Tap Edit at the top left to delete or reorder."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "キーバーの稲妻から：タップで入力、ダブルタップでReturn付きで実行。左上の「編集」で削除や並べ替えができます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在键栏的闪电里：单击输入，双击带回车执行。左上角「编辑」可以删除、排序。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
