    "Incomplete reminders in the lists you choose become to-dos, and later changes to their title, notes or due date follow. Nothing is written back to Reminders; completing or deleting a reminder leaves its to-do as it is. Imports happen while Persona is open." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Incomplete reminders in the lists you choose become to-dos, and later changes to their title, notes or due date follow. Nothing is written back to Reminders; completing or deleting a reminder leaves its to-do as it is. Imports happen while Persona is open."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "選んだリストの未完了のリマインダーが ToDo になり、その後のタイトル、メモ、期限の変更も反映されます。リマインダーには書き戻しません。リマインダーを完了または削除しても ToDo はそのままです。取り込みは Persona を開いている間に行われます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选列表中未完成的提醒事项会成为待办，之后它们的标题、备注或截止时间改动也会同步过来。不会写回提醒事项；完成或删除提醒事项不影响对应的待办。只在 Persona 打开时导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
