    "It appears in the machine list, and you can pick it when you start a new agent." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It appears in the machine list, and you can pick it when you start a new agent."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "マシンの一覧に表示され、新しいエージェントを始めるときに選べます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它会出现在机器列表里，新建 Agent 时可以选它。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "It can see the screen, tap and type through a computer it's paired with. Sensitive steps still ask you first. You can turn this off here at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It can see the screen, tap and type through a computer it's paired with. Sensitive steps still ask you first. You can turn this off here at any time."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ペアリング済みのコンピューターを通して画面の確認、タップ、入力ができます。重要な操作は引き続き先に確認します。ここでいつでもオフにできます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它能经配对过的电脑看屏幕、点按和输入。敏感操作仍会先问你。随时可以在这里关掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It carries on by itself when the call ends, or when you come back to Persona." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It carries on by itself when the call ends, or when you come back to Persona."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通話が終わるか、Personaに戻ると自動で続きを録音します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通话结束或回到 Persona 时会自动继续。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It changed after you opened it (at %@), maybe by an Agent or another app. Saving now would overwrite those changes." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It changed after you opened it (at %1$@), maybe by an Agent or another app. Saving now would overwrite those changes."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開いた後（%1$@）に、Agent や別のアプリで変更されたようです。いま保存するとその変更が上書きされます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你打开之后，它在 %1$@ 被改了（可能是 Agent 或别的程序）。直接存会把那些改动冲掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It changed after you opened it, maybe by an Agent or another app. Saving now would overwrite those changes." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "It changed after you opened it, maybe by an Agent or another app. Saving now would overwrite those changes."
          }
