    "Letters, digits, _, and -. You pick it by this name everywhere." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Letters, digits, _, and -. You pick it by this name everywhere."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "英字、数字、_、-が使えます。どこでもこの名前で選択します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "字母、数字、_ 和 -；在各处按这个名字选择。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Level %lld" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Level %1$lld"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第%1$lld階層"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第 %1$lld 层"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Levels are checked from the top. The first level with a matching rule decides: the message is stored if any matching rule there is on, and not stored if they are all off. Lower levels are not checked. Turning a rule off only stops new messages; what is stored stays until its days run out." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Levels are checked from the top. The first level with a matching rule decides: the message is stored if any matching rule there is on, and not stored if they are all off. Lower levels are not checked. Turning a rule off only stops new messages; what is stored stays until its days run out."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上の優先度から順に確認します。一致するルールがある最初の優先度で決まり、一致したルールが 1 つでもオンなら保存、すべてオフなら保存しません。それより下は確認しません。ルールをオフにしても新しいメッセージの保存が止まるだけで、保存済みの内容は保持日数が過ぎるまで残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从上往下依次检查各级。第一个有规则匹配的级别说了算：其中匹配的规则只要有一条开着就保存，全关着就不保存，不再往下看。关掉规则只是不再保存新消息，已保存的会留到保留天数用完。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
