            "value" : "消息发进主对话（/new、/list 换一段），回答发回飞书"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Messages here are just for you: they aren't stored on the hub or handed to AI, and viewing them doesn't mark them as read. Persona is read-only and never sends messages for you." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Messages here are just for you: they aren't stored on the hub or handed to AI, and viewing them doesn't mark them as read. Persona is read-only and never sends messages for you."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ここのメッセージはあなただけが見られます。ハブには保存されず、AIにも渡されず、見ても既読になりません。Personaは読み取り専用で、代わりにメッセージを送ることはありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "消息只在这里给你自己看：不存到 hub、不交给 AI，看了也不会标成已读。Persona 只读，不会替你发消息。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Messages now go to the agent picked with /agents in Lark. You can switch back to a Persona chat here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Messages now go to the agent picked with /agents in Lark. You can switch back to a Persona chat here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "現在はLarkで/agentsで選んだエージェントに送られます。ここでPersonaのチャットに戻すこともできます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
