    "Off by default. After you enable this, a workout of at least 10 minutes is reported right after it is saved to Health, even while Persona is closed: its measurements go to your hub to create a report. Older workouts are not imported. Reports already submitted may finish after you turn this off." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off by default. After you enable this, a workout of at least 10 minutes is reported right after it is saved to Health, even while Persona is closed: its measurements go to your hub to create a report. Older workouts are not imported. Reports already submitted may finish after you turn this off."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "初期設定はオフです。有効にすると、10分以上のワークアウトがヘルスケアに保存された直後に、Persona を開いていなくてもレポートを作成します。測定データは hub に送信されます。有効にする前の運動は取り込みません。オフにしても、送信済みのレポートは完了する場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认关闭。开启后，至少持续 10 分钟的运动一存进「健康」就会生成报告，Persona 没打开也一样：运动数据会发送到你的 hub 生成报告。不导入开启前的运动。关闭后，已提交的报告仍可能完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. After you enable this, opening Persona checks for new workouts of at least 10 minutes and sends their measurements to your hub to create a report. Older workouts are not imported. Reports already submitted may finish after you turn this off." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off by default. After you enable this, opening Persona checks for new workouts of at least 10 minutes and sends their measurements to your hub to create a report. Older workouts are not imported. Reports already submitted may finish after you turn this off."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "初期設定はオフです。有効にすると、Persona を開いた際に新しい10分以上のワークアウトを確認し、測定データを hub に送信してレポートを作成します。有効にする前の運動は取り込みません。オフにしても、送信済みのレポートは完了する場合があります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认关闭。开启后，打开 Persona 会检查新完成且至少持续 10 分钟的运动，并将运动数据发送到你的 hub 生成报告。不导入开启前的运动。关闭后，已提交的报告仍可能完成。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Off by default. When on, you can send this phone's clipboard to this computer and get the computer's here. Nothing is kept on the hub." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Off by default. When on, you can send this phone's clipboard to this computer and get the computer's here. Nothing is kept on the hub."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "既定ではオフです。オンにすると、このスマートフォンのクリップボードをこのコンピュータに送ったり、コンピュータのクリップボードをここに取り込んだりできます。内容は hub に残りません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认关闭。打开后，可以把手机的剪贴板发到这台电脑，也能把电脑的剪贴板取到手机上；内容不会留在 hub 上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
