    "On by default: only clearly unusable names are fixed, once per session, with your information sorting model. Names you set are never replaced. Regular updates come only after new output and count toward the limit." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On by default: only clearly unusable names are fixed, once per session, with your information sorting model. Names you set are never replaced. Regular updates come only after new output and count toward the limit."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "既定でオン：明らかに使えない名前だけを、セッションごとに 1 回、情報整理モデルで修正します。自分で付けた名前は置き換えません。定期的な更新は新しい出力があったときだけ行われ、回数に含まれます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认开启：只修正明显没法用的名字，每个会话一次，用你选的信息分拣模型；你自己起的名字不会被换掉。定期更新只在有新输出时进行，也算进次数。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On by default: what you ask for in a chat starts at once; tasks Persona thinks of itself still wait for Start. Read-only tasks never get a new workspace, and a busy folder gets its own copy." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On by default: what you ask for in a chat starts at once; tasks Persona thinks of itself still wait for Start. Read-only tasks never get a new workspace, and a busy folder gets its own copy."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "既定でオン：チャットで頼んだことはすぐに始まり、Persona が自分で考えたタスクは「開始」を待ちます。読み取り専用のタスクは新しいワークスペースを作らず、使用中のフォルダでは別のコピーを使います。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "默认开启：你在对话里让 Persona 做的事会直接开始；Persona 自己想到的任务仍等你点「开始」。只读任务不新建工作区，目录正被占用时另开一份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On demand" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On demand"
          }
