      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "On no to-do; often started from Lark, the phone or elsewhere. Touch and hold one › Link to To-do… to file it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On no to-do; often started from Lark, the phone or elsewhere. Touch and hold one › Link to To-do… to file it."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没挂在任何待办上，常是从飞书、手机或别的入口开的。长按一行 › 关联到待办… 可以归过去。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どのToDoにも関連付けられていないエージェントです。多くはLarkやスマートフォンなど、ほかの場所から開始されたものです。行を長押し ›「ToDoに関連付け…」で関連付けられます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On pace" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On pace"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ペース通り"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "节奏正常"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "On permission and plan notifications you can Allow/Approve (after unlocking) or Deny/Reject directly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On permission and plan notifications you can Allow/Approve (after unlocking) or Deny/Reject directly."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "許可やプランの通知から直接「許可／承認」（ロック解除が必要）または「拒否／差し戻し」ができます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "授权和计划的通知上可以直接「允许 / 批准」（要先解锁）或「拒绝 / 打回」。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "On permission and plan notifications you can Allow/Approve or Deny/Reject directly (hover over the notification and click Options)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On permission and plan notifications you can Allow/Approve or Deny/Reject directly (hover over the notification and click Options)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "許可やプランの通知から直接「許可／承認」または「拒否／差し戻し」ができます（通知にポインタを合わせて「オプション」をクリック）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "授权和计划的通知上可以直接「允许 / 批准」或「拒绝 / 打回」（把鼠标移到通知上，点「选项」）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "On that Mac, open System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility and turn on Cua Driver" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On that Mac, open System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility and turn on Cua Driver"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そのMacで「システム設定 › プライバシーとセキュリティ › アクセシビリティ」を開き、「Cua Driver」をオンにします"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在那台 Mac 上打开「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 辅助功能」，打开「Cua Driver」的开关"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "On that Mac, open System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen & System Audio Recording (Screen Recording on older macOS) and turn on Cua Driver" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On that Mac, open System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen & System Audio Recording (Screen Recording on older macOS) and turn on Cua Driver"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そのMacで「システム設定 › プライバシーとセキュリティ › 画面収録とシステムオーディオ録音」（以前のmacOSでは「画面収録」）を開き、「Cua Driver」をオンにします"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在那台 Mac 上打开「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 录屏与系统录音」（旧版 macOS 叫「屏幕录制」），打开「Cua Driver」的开关"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "On that Mac, turn on Persona Screen in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen & System Audio Recording." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On that Mac, turn on Persona Screen in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen & System Audio Recording."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "その Mac の「システム設定 › プライバシーとセキュリティ › 画面収録とシステムオーディオ録音」で Persona Screen をオンにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在那台 Mac 的「系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 录屏与系统录音」里打开 Persona Screen。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "On that computer, open a terminal, paste the line below and press Return. It installs Persona and connects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On that computer, open a terminal, paste the line below and press Return. It installs Persona and connects."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そのコンピュータでターミナルを開き、下の 1 行を貼り付けて Return を押してください。Persona がインストールされ、接続されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在那台电脑上打开终端，粘贴下面这一行，回车。它会装好 Persona 并连上来。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "On that computer, put Persona's two programs in one folder. There is no installer yet: you build them yourself, and the tray app is still being made." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On that computer, put Persona's two programs in one folder. There is no installer yet: you build them yourself, and the tray app is still being made."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そのコンピュータで、Persona の 2 つのプログラムを同じフォルダに置いてください。まだインストーラはなく自分でビルドする必要があり、トレイアプリも開発中です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在那台电脑上把 Persona 的两个程序放在同一个文件夹里。目前还没有安装包，要自己编译，托盘程序也还在做。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "On the Hub [Meeting Transcription]" : {
