    },
    "Once google.client_id is in the assistant's manager.json and the hub restarts, “Sign In with Google” appears here (a one-time setup). Until then, add the account with an app password: turn on 2-Step Verification for the Google account, then create a 16-character password under Google Account › Security › App passwords and enter it here (not your Google password)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once google.client_id is in the assistant's manager.json and the hub restarts, “Sign In with Google” appears here (a one-time setup). Until then, add the account with an app password: turn on 2-Step Verification for the Google account, then create a 16-character password under Google Account › Security › App passwords and enter it here (not your Google password)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アシスタントの manager.json に google.client_id を追加してハブを再起動すると、ここに「Googleでサインイン」が表示されます（初回のみの設定）。それまではアプリパスワードで追加できます。Google アカウントで 2 段階認証プロセスを有効にし、Google アカウント › セキュリティ › アプリパスワードで 16 文字のパスワードを作成してここに入力してください（Google のログインパスワードではありません）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在助手的 manager.json 里写上 google.client_id 并重启 hub 后，这里会出现「使用 Google 账号登录」（一次性配置）。在那之前可以用应用专用密码添加：Google 账号先开两步验证，再到 Google 账号 › 安全性 › 应用专用密码 生成一个 16 位密码填在这里（不是 Google 登录密码）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Once it connects, you'll be asked here whether it's yours." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once it connects, you'll be asked here whether it's yours."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接続すると、あなたのコンピュータかどうかをここで確認します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它连上来以后，这里会问你是不是你的电脑。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Once it connects, you'll be asked here whether it's yours. If that computer never got the pairing link, make a new one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once it connects, you'll be asked here whether it's yours. If that computer never got the pairing link, make a new one."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接続すると、あなたのコンピュータかどうかをここで確認します。そのコンピュータがペアリングリンクを受け取っていなければ、新しく作ってください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它连上来以后，这里会问你是不是你的电脑。那台电脑还没拿到配对链接，就重新出一个。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Once it says it's paired, you're done: this screen moves on by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once it says it's paired, you're done: this screen moves on by itself."
