      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Once its checks and reviews pass, GitHub merges it into %@ (%@) without asking again. %@ is kept, here and on GitHub." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once its checks and reviews pass, GitHub merges it into %1$@ (%2$@) without asking again. %3$@ is kept, here and on GitHub."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "チェックとレビューが通ると、GitHub が「%2$@」で %1$@ にマージします。もう一度は聞きません。%3$@ ブランチは残ります（ローカルにも GitHub にも）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "检查和评审都通过后，GitHub 会用「%2$@」把它合进 %1$@，不再询问。%3$@ 分支会保留（本地和 GitHub 上都不删）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Once pasted, it's tested once: a very short request that may cost a little." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "粘贴后会自动测试一次：发一条很短的请求，可能产生少量费用。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once pasted, it's tested once: a very short request that may cost a little."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "貼り付けると 1 回自動でテストします：ごく短いリクエストで、少額の費用がかかる場合があります。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Once sent back to the phone it's transcribed on device; the text goes into Knowledge automatically and the audio isn't uploaded." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once sent back to the phone it's transcribed on device; the text goes into Knowledge automatically and the audio isn't uploaded."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "スマートフォンに戻った後にデバイス上で文字起こしし、文字は自動でナレッジに入ります。音声はアップロードされません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "回传手机后本机转写，文字自动进知识库，音频不上传。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Once signed in, come back here and send a message to try it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once signed in, come back here and send a message to try it."
