    "Persona already saw it. It is told not to use it again, and it leaves the minutes." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona already saw it. It is told not to use it again, and it leaves the minutes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona 已经看过这张照片。会告诉它不要再用，纪要里也会去掉它。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona はこの写真をすでに見ています。今後は使わないよう伝え、議事録からも外します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persona and the assistant never see the values." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona and the assistant never see the values."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona とアシスタントは値を見ません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona 和助手都看不到这些值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persona answers only from meeting material: earlier minutes, project progress and who owns a to-do. It never brings up private chats, mail or health." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona answers only from meeting material: earlier minutes, project progress and who owns a to-do. It never brings up private chats, mail or health."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona は会議に関わる内容だけで答えます：過去の議事録、プロジェクトの進み具合、To-Do の担当者。個人的なチャット、メール、健康には触れません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona 只用会议相关的内容回答：以前的会议纪要、项目进展、待办归谁。不会提私人聊天、邮件或健康。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persona asks again with what this is and why." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona asks again with what this is and why."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona が内容と理由を添えてもう一度尋ねます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona 补上这是什么、为什么做，再问一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persona asks you before it merges, pushes, deploys, sends messages, deletes data or spends money. When you tell it in a chat to always go ahead somewhere, that go-ahead is listed here." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona asks you before it merges, pushes, deploys, sends messages, deletes data or spends money. When you tell it in a chat to always go ahead somewhere, that go-ahead is listed here."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona は、マージ、プッシュ、デプロイ、メッセージの送信、データの削除、支払いの前にあなたに確認します。チャットで「今後はそのまま進めてよい」と伝えると、その承認がここに表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona 在合入、推送、部署、发消息、删除数据或花钱之前，都会先问你。你在对话里让它以后在某处直接做，这条授权就会列在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
