        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona tries again the next time it opens. If it keeps failing, give the hub its own APNs key (apns.json)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "次に Persona を開いたときにまた試します。失敗が続く場合は hub に APNs キー（apns.json）を設定してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下次打开 Persona 会再试。一直失败就给 hub 配上自己的 APNs key（apns.json）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persona uses these for reminders like “remind me to buy milk on the way home”. It adds a place here only after you confirm it in a chat." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona uses these for reminders like “remind me to buy milk on the way home”. It adds a place here only after you confirm it in a chat."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona はこれらの場所を「帰り道に牛乳を買うよう知らせて」のようなリマインダーに使います。チャットで確認した場所だけがここに追加されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona 用这些地点做「回家路上提醒我买牛奶」这样的提醒。只有你在对话里确认过，它才会把地点加到这里。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Persona will ask you again before it does this in %@ on %@: %@. Work already done isn't affected. To grant it again, ask Persona in the main chat." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona will ask you again before it does this in %1$@ on %2$@: %3$@. Work already done isn't affected. To grant it again, ask Persona in the main chat."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今後 %2$@ の %1$@ で%3$@を行う前に、Persona はもう一度あなたに確認します。すでに完了した作業には影響しません。もう一度承認するには、メインチャットで Persona に頼んでください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以后在 %2$@ 上的 %1$@ 里%3$@之前，Persona 会重新先问你。已经做完的工作不受影响。想再次授权，在主对话里告诉 Persona。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Persona will use %@ from the next message" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona will use %1$@ from the next message"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "次のメッセージからPersonaは%1$@を使います"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona 下一条消息起使用 %1$@"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Persona woke it up to check whether “%@” is ready" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona woke it up to check whether “%1$@” is ready"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Personaが起こしました：「%1$@」の準備ができたか確認します"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona 叫醒了它：看看「%1$@」好了没有"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Persona works on one of your computers, with a model. Each step below ticks itself once it's done; no need to refresh." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona works on one of your computers, with a model. Each step below ticks itself once it's done; no need to refresh."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona はあなたのコンピュータの 1 台で、モデルを使って動きます。下の各ステップは完了すると自動でチェックが付きます。再読み込みは不要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona 要在你的一台电脑上、用一个模型干活。下面每一步做完会自己打勾，不用刷新。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
