    "Reports contain measurement cards, heart-rate and pace charts when data is available, a comparison with your recent workouts of the same kind, and a brief summary. Health read permissions are managed in iOS Settings; an empty result can also mean access was not granted." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Reports contain measurement cards, heart-rate and pace charts when data is available, a comparison with your recent workouts of the same kind, and a brief summary. Health read permissions are managed in iOS Settings; an empty result can also mean access was not granted."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "レポートには測定値カード、データがある場合は心拍数とペースのグラフ、最近の同じ種類のワークアウトとの比較、簡潔なまとめが含まれます。ヘルスケアの読み取り権限は iOS の設定で管理できます。結果が空の場合、権限が許可されていない可能性もあります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "报告包含数据卡片、有数据时的心率图和配速图、与最近同类运动的对比，以及简短总结。健康数据读取权限可在 iOS 设置中管理；没有读取到运动也可能是未授予权限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
