    "Records all the sound around you, other people included, so ask them first. Your iPhone turns it into text for your hub's recap of your day; the audio stays on your watch and iPhone and is deleted within 7 days." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Records all the sound around you, other people included, so ask them first. Your iPhone turns it into text for your hub's recap of your day; the audio stays on your watch and iPhone and is deleted within 7 days."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "会录下你身边的所有声音，包括其他人说的话，所以请先征得他们同意。iPhone 会把它转成文字，供 hub 写出当日回顾；音频只留在你的手表和 iPhone 上，7 天内删除。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "周りのすべての音を、他の人の声も含めて録音します。先に相手の同意を得てください。iPhoneがテキストにし、ハブがそこから1日のまとめを作成します。音声はApple WatchとiPhoneにだけ保存され、7日以内に削除されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Records are kept for 90 days by default." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
