    "Saved before computer scopes existed: it still runs on every computer, work ones included, and each keeps a copy of the key. Changing anything here and saving makes the scope what you set." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Saved before computer scopes existed: it still runs on every computer, work ones included, and each keeps a copy of the key. Changing anything here and saving makes the scope what you set."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个供应商是在有电脑范围之前存的：它仍在所有电脑上运行（包括工作电脑），每台都存一份 Key。在这里改动任何一项并保存后，范围就按这里的设置来。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "コンピューターの範囲ができる前に保存されたプロバイダーです。仕事用を含むすべてのコンピューターで動き、各コンピューターにキーが保存されます。ここで何か変更して保存すると、範囲はこの設定どおりになります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
