    "Scheduled tasks run in the background. When one needs your approval you get a notification, and it waits until someone responds. To let it run commands without asking, choose “Auto” (it judges the risk itself)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scheduled tasks run in the background. When one needs your approval you get a notification, and it waits until someone responds. To let it run commands without asking, choose “Auto” (it judges the risk itself)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "定期タスクはバックグラウンドで実行されます。承認が必要なときは通知が届き、応答があるまで待ちます。確認なしでコマンドを実行させたい場合は「自動」（リスクを自分で判断）を選びます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "定时任务在后台跑，要你批准时会推送到手机，没人点就一直等着。要它跑命令也不问你，可以选「自动」（自己判断风险）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
