    "Servers fill in automatically for QQ, 163, iCloud and similar. Most mail providers in China need an authorization code instead of your login password. For Outlook, use the “Outlook” option above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Servers fill in automatically for QQ, 163, iCloud and similar. Most mail providers in China need an authorization code instead of your login password. For Outlook, use the “Outlook” option above."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "QQ / 163 / iCloudなどはサーバーが自動入力されます。中国のメールサービスでは通常、ログインパスワードではなく「認証コード」が必要です。Outlookは上の「Outlook」からサインインしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "QQ / 163 / iCloud 等会自动填服务器；国内邮箱一般要用「授权码」而不是登录密码。Outlook 用上面的「Outlook」登录。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Servers fill in automatically. The password is an authorization code, not your QQ password: on a computer, open QQ Mail on the web, go to Settings › Account & Security › Security Settings, turn on “POP3/IMAP/SMTP/Exchange/CardDAV service”, verify as prompted, then tap “Generate authorization code” and paste the 16-character code above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Servers fill in automatically. The password is an authorization code, not your QQ password: on a computer, open QQ Mail on the web, go to Settings › Account & Security › Security Settings, turn on “POP3/IMAP/SMTP/Exchange/CardDAV service”, verify as prompted, then tap “Generate authorization code” and paste the 16-character code above."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サーバーは自動で入力されます。パスワードにはQQのパスワードではなく認証コードを入力します。パソコンでWeb版QQメールを開き、設定 › アカウントとセキュリティ › セキュリティ設定で「POP3/IMAP/SMTP/Exchange/CardDAVサービス」をオンにし、案内に従って認証したあと「認証コードを生成」を押して、16文字の認証コードを上に貼り付けてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器会自动填好。密码要填授权码，不是 QQ 密码：在电脑上打开网页版 QQ 邮箱，进入 设置 › 账号与安全 › 安全设置，开启「POP3/IMAP/SMTP/Exchange/CardDAV 服务」，按提示验证后点「生成授权码」，把 16 位授权码粘贴到上面。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Servers fill in automatically. The password is an authorization code, not your login password: on a computer, open NetEase Mail on the web, go to Settings › POP3/SMTP/IMAP and turn on “IMAP/SMTP service”. After you verify with your phone as prompted, the code is shown: paste it above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Servers fill in automatically. The password is an authorization code, not your login password: on a computer, open NetEase Mail on the web, go to Settings › POP3/SMTP/IMAP and turn on “IMAP/SMTP service”. After you verify with your phone as prompted, the code is shown: paste it above."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "サーバーは自動で入力されます。パスワードにはログインパスワードではなく認証コードを入力します。パソコンでWeb版NetEaseメールを開き、設定 › POP3/SMTP/IMAPで「IMAP/SMTPサービス」をオンにしてください。案内に従って携帯電話で認証すると認証コードが表示されるので、上に貼り付けてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "服务器会自动填好。密码要填授权码，不是登录密码：在电脑上打开网页版网易邮箱，进入 设置 › POP3/SMTP/IMAP，开启「IMAP/SMTP 服务」，按提示用手机验证后会显示授权码，把它粘贴到上面。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Servers the agent starts show up here. To list your own, add .claude/launch.json to the project:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Servers the agent starts show up here. To list your own, add .claude/launch.json to the project:"
