    "Starts in Claude's desktop app. With no folder it goes to one temporary folder beside the app's projects; a new folder is made when it starts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Starts in Claude's desktop app. With no folder it goes to one temporary folder beside the app's projects; a new folder is made when it starts."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Claude 桌面版里新建会话。不选文件夹时放进桌面版项目旁边统一的临时会话文件夹；新建的文件夹会在会话开始时创建。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Claude デスクトップアプリでセッションを開始します。フォルダを選ばない場合は、アプリのプロジェクトの隣にある共通の一時フォルダに入ります。新しいフォルダはセッション開始時に作成されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starts in the Codex App. With no folder it goes where the App keeps chats in no project; a new folder is made when it starts." : {
