          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap the clipboard in the bottom bar: “%@” puts your text on the Mac’s clipboard and pastes it; “%@” brings over the text on the Mac’s clipboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点底栏的剪贴板：「%1$@」把这边的文字放进 Mac 的剪贴板并粘贴；「%2$@」把 Mac 剪贴板里的文字拿过来。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the clipboard in the bottom bar: “%1$@” puts your text on the Mac’s clipboard and pastes it; “%2$@” brings over the text on the Mac’s clipboard."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下部バーのクリップボードをタップします。「%1$@」はこちらのテキストをMacのクリップボードに入れてペーストし、「%2$@」はMacのクリップボードのテキストを取り込みます。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Tap the keyboard button at the right of the key bar to show the keyboard; every key goes straight to the terminal (like on a computer, with input methods and dictation). Double-tap the keyboard button for Return. Tapping the terminal taps inside it (such as Claude's “Jump to bottom”) and doesn't show the keyboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the keyboard button at the right of the key bar to show the keyboard; every key goes straight to the terminal (like on a computer, with input methods and dictation). Double-tap the keyboard button for Return. Tapping the terminal taps inside it (such as Claude's “Jump to bottom”) and doesn't show the keyboard."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "キーバー右端のキーボードボタンでキーボードを表示すると、すべてのキーがそのままターミナルに送られます（コンピューターと同じく、入力方式や音声入力も使えます）。キーボードボタンのダブルタップでReturnです。ターミナルのタップはターミナル内のタップになり（Claudeの「Jump to bottom」など）、キーボードは表示されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点键栏右边的键盘按钮弹出键盘，每个键直接发到终端（像在电脑上一样，输入法、听写都能用）；双击键盘按钮是回车。点终端是点在终端里（比如 Claude 的「Jump to bottom」），不会弹键盘。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Tap the keyboard in the bottom bar. The row above the keyboard has Mac shortcuts: tap ⌘ ⌥ ⌃ ⇧ to hold, tap again to release, plus Esc, Tab, arrow keys, and ⌘C ⌘V ⌘Z ⌘Tab ⌘Space. Input methods such as Chinese work as usual; the committed text is pasted over through the clipboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the keyboard in the bottom bar. The row above the keyboard has Mac shortcuts: tap ⌘ ⌥ ⌃ ⇧ to hold, tap again to release, plus Esc, Tab, arrow keys, and ⌘C ⌘V ⌘Z ⌘Tab ⌘Space. Input methods such as Chinese work as usual; the committed text is pasted over through the clipboard."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下部バーのキーボードをタップします。キーボードの上の列はMacのショートカットです。⌘ ⌥ ⌃ ⇧は1回タップで押したまま、もう一度タップで離します。Esc、Tab、矢印キー、⌘C ⌘V ⌘Z ⌘Tab ⌘スペースもあります。日本語入力もそのまま使え、確定した文字はクリップボード経由でペーストされます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点底栏的键盘。键盘上面一排是 Mac 的快捷键：⌘ ⌥ ⌃ ⇧ 点一下按住、再点松开，还有 Esc、Tab、方向键和 ⌘C ⌘V ⌘Z ⌘Tab ⌘空格。中文照常输入，上屏的字经剪贴板粘贴过去。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Tap the rotate button next to the clipboard to turn the screen sideways for a larger view, and tap it again to turn it back upright. Once tapped, the screen keeps that orientation until you close it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the rotate button next to the clipboard to turn the screen sideways for a larger view, and tap it again to turn it back upright. Once tapped, the screen keeps that orientation until you close it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "クリップボードの横にある回転ボタンをタップすると横向きになり、大きく表示されます。もう一度タップすると縦向きに戻ります。タップした後は、閉じるまでその向きのままです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点剪贴板旁边的转屏按钮，画面转成横屏、显示更大；再点一下转回竖屏。点过以后，画面保持这个方向，直到关掉。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Tap the terminal: the tap goes to the terminal (Claude's “Jump to bottom”, questions at the top)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap the terminal: the tap goes to the terminal (Claude's “Jump to bottom”, questions at the top)"
