    "Tasks from the main chat no longer send their progress (a finished turn, waiting for you, interrupted), which stays in the to-do list and the briefing; a conclusion card still comes when there is one: done, can't be done, or needs your decision" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tasks from the main chat no longer send their progress (a finished turn, waiting for you, interrupted), which stays in the to-do list and the briefing; a conclusion card still comes when there is one: done, can't be done, or needs your decision"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "メインチャットのタスクの途中経過（ひと区切りの完了・あなた待ち・中断）は単独では送らずやることリストとブリーフィングにだけ残し、結論（完了・できない・あなたの判断が必要）が出たら結論カードをこれまでどおり送ります"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主对话派出的任务不再推中途进展（一轮做完、在等你、被打断，照样记在待办和早晚报里）；有结论时照样推一张结论卡：做完了、做不了、要你拍板"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Tasks started from the main chat stay out of the Dynamic Island, notifications, and badges. Persona tells you in the main chat when they finish, need your answer, or fail. Only affects tasks started from now on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tasks started from the main chat stay out of the Dynamic Island, notifications, and badges. Persona tells you in the main chat when they finish, need your answer, or fail. Only affects tasks started from now on."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "メインチャットから任せたタスクはDynamic Island、通知、バッジに表示されません。完了したとき、回答が必要なとき、エラーのときはPersonaがメインチャットで知らせます。今後任せるタスクにのみ適用されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主对话派出去的任务不进灵动岛、推送和角标，做完、等你回答或出错时由 Persona 在主对话里告诉你。只影响之后派的任务。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
