    "The Lark account is signed in through the Lark gateway on the hub machine. Chats share this account with the Inbox, so there's no need to sign in again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Lark account is signed in through the Lark gateway on the hub machine. Chats share this account with the Inbox, so there's no need to sign in again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "LarkアカウントはハブのマシンのLarkゲートウェイでログインします。チャットは受信トレイとこのアカウントを共有するため、再ログインは不要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "飞书账号在 hub 所在机器的飞书网关里登录，会话与收件箱共用这个账号，无需再次登录。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "The Lark gateway on the hub machine isn't signed in to Lark. Sign in to the Lark gateway again on that machine, then come back and retry." : {
