    "The Picture in Picture button next to Close floats the screen over other apps and the Home Screen; tap it to come back here. Picture in Picture is view-only, and closing it disconnects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The Picture in Picture button next to Close floats the screen over other apps and the Home Screen; tap it to come back here. Picture in Picture is view-only, and closing it disconnects."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「閉じる」の隣の「ピクチャ・イン・ピクチャ」ボタンで画面を小さなウインドウにして、ほかのAppやホーム画面の上に表示し続けます。タップするとここに戻ります。表示のみで、閉じると切断されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭按钮旁边的「小窗」把画面放进画中画，切到别的 App 或回到桌面也浮着；点小窗回到这里。小窗只能看，关掉小窗就断开。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "The SSH server didn't accept this device's public key. Add the line from Copy authorized_keys Line to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys for %@ on the server (Warpgate: add it to this user's public keys), then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The SSH server didn't accept this device's public key. Add the line from Copy authorized_keys Line to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys for %1$@ on the server (Warpgate: add it to this user's public keys), then try again."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSHサーバーがこのデバイスの公開鍵を受け入れませんでした。「authorized_keysの行をコピー」でコピーした行をサーバー上の%1$@の~/.ssh/authorized_keysに追加し（Warpgateの場合はこのユーザーの公開鍵に追加）、もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "SSH 服务器没有接受这台设备的公钥。把「复制 authorized_keys 行」拷的那一行加到服务器上 %1$@ 的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys（Warpgate：加到这个用户的公钥里），再试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "The action didn't complete" : {
