    "The app asks every address at once and uses the first in this order that answers; a later one only when the earlier ones don't. The paired address always comes first." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The app asks every address at once and uses the first in this order that answers; a later one only when the earlier ones don't. The paired address always comes first."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アプリはすべてのアドレスに同時に問い合わせ、この順序で最初に応答したものを使います。後のアドレスは、それより前のものが応答しないときだけ使います。ペアリングしたアドレスは常に先頭です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 会同时探测所有地址，按这里的顺序用第一个有响应的；排在前面的都连不上，才会用后面的。配对时的地址始终排第一。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app asks every address at once and uses the first in this order that answers; a later one when the earlier ones don't answer quickly. The paired address always comes first." : {
