          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "The machines, agents, chats, and inbox you see are demo data. Nothing connects to a server, and messages, approvals, and other actions aren't actually sent. Connecting your own hub exits demo mode automatically." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The machines, agents, chats, and inbox you see are demo data. Nothing connects to a server, and messages, approvals, and other actions aren't actually sent. Connecting your own hub exits demo mode automatically."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "表示されているマシン、エージェント、チャット、受信トレイはすべてデモデータです。サーバーには接続せず、メッセージの送信や承認などの操作も実際には送られません。自分のハブに接続すると自動的にデモモードを終了します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "现在看到的机器、Agent、对话和收件箱都是演示数据，不连接任何服务器，发消息、审批等操作也不会真的发出去。连接自己的 hub 后自动退出体验模式。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "The main chat and Agents can't run on it. Processing, Sorting and other uses without a picked model may now use it; change that under Models." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主对话和 Agent 不能用它。信息处理、信息筛选等没有单独选模型的用途，现在可能会改用它；要调整，到「模型配置」里选。"
          }
        },
        "en" : {
