    "This edits ~/.claude/settings.json on that machine and changes only the settings below. New Claude sessions pick them up; running sessions usually need a restart." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This edits ~/.claude/settings.json on that machine and changes only the settings below. New Claude sessions pick them up; running sessions usually need a restart."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "そのマシンの~/.claude/settings.jsonのうち、下の項目だけを変更します。新しいClaudeセッションに反映され、実行中のセッションには通常再起動が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "改的是那台机器的 ~/.claude/settings.json，只动下面这几项；新开的 Claude 会话生效，正在跑的会话一般要重启才生效。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "This edits ~/.codex/config.toml on that machine and changes only the settings below; everything else in the file (model providers, project trust, and so on) stays as is. New Codex sessions pick them up." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
