        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "This is added to the end of Persona's instructions and applies to new chats. You might note where your code lives, which skills you use, which machines or folders to leave alone, and how you like to get updates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is added to the end of Persona's instructions and applies to new chats. You might note where your code lives, which skills you use, which machines or folders to leave alone, and how you like to get updates."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "この内容はPersonaへの指示の最後に追加され、新しいチャットから反映されます。コードの場所、よく使うskills、触れてはいけないマシンやフォルダ、報告の好みなどを書けます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些内容会附在 Persona 的说明最后；改了以后新对话生效。可以写代码放在哪、常用哪些 skills、哪些机器或目录别碰、你习惯的汇报方式。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "This is demo mode: your message didn't actually reach a computer, and the agents here are sample data. Once you connect your own hub, Claude carries on on that computer." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is demo mode: your message didn't actually reach a computer, and the agents here are sample data. Once you connect your own hub, Claude carries on on that computer."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これはデモモードです。メッセージは実際にはコンピューターに送信されておらず、ここのエージェントもデモ用のデータです。自分のハブに接続すると、Claudeがそのコンピューターで作業を続けます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是体验模式：消息没有真的发到电脑上，这里的 Agent 也只是演示数据。连接你自己的 hub 之后，Claude 会在那台电脑上接着做。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "This is listed again before installing, based on the downloaded package. If a new version asks for more, the extra permissions are listed before the update." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This is listed again before installing, based on the downloaded package. If a new version asks for more, the extra permissions are listed before the update."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "インストール前に、ダウンロードしたパッケージに基づいて再度表示されます。新しいバージョンがより多くを求める場合は、アップデート前に追加分を表示します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安装前会再列一次，以下载到的包为准；新版本要得更多时，升级前会单独列出多出来的。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
