    "Through a computer it's paired with, the assistant can see this iPhone's screen, tap and type. Paying, sending, deleting and other sensitive steps ask you first. That computer must also be turned on, on its page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Through a computer it's paired with, the assistant can see this iPhone's screen, tap and type. Paying, sending, deleting and other sensitive steps ask you first. That computer must also be turned on, on its page."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ペアリング済みのコンピューターを通して、アシスタントはこのiPhoneの画面の確認、タップ、入力ができます。支払い、送信、削除などの重要な操作は先に確認します。そのコンピューターもそのページでオンにする必要があります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "经配对过的电脑，助手能看这台 iPhone 的屏幕、点按和输入。付款、发送、删除等敏感操作会先问你。那台电脑也要在它的机器页上打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
