    "Under Permissions, enable: read and send direct messages (im:message, im:message:send_as_bot), receive direct messages sent to the bot, and upload and download message resources. Reading contact names helps too (contact:user.base:readonly)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Under Permissions, enable: read and send direct messages (im:message, im:message:send_as_bot), receive direct messages sent to the bot, and upload and download message resources. Reading contact names helps too (contact:user.base:readonly)"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "権限で次を有効にします：個別チャットのメッセージの読み取りと送信（im:message、im:message:send_as_bot）、個別チャットでボットに送られたメッセージの取得、メッセージ内リソースのアップロードとダウンロード。連絡先の名前を読めるとさらに便利です（contact:user.base:readonly）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "权限里开通：读取与发送单聊消息（im:message、im:message:send_as_bot）、获取单聊中发给机器人的消息、上传和下载消息里的资源；能读通讯录名字更好（contact:user.base:readonly）"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
