            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "エージェントが要対応のとき"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有 Agent 需要你时"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When an agent is waiting for you to do something on the computer, tap “I'm Done” in the bottom bar when you're finished and it carries on. Closing the screen also hands it back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When an agent is waiting for you to do something on the computer, tap “I'm Done” in the bottom bar when you're finished and it carries on. Closing the screen also hands it back."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "エージェントがコンピューターでの操作を待っているときは、終わったら下部バーの「完了しました」をタップすると作業を続けます。画面を閉じても返したことになります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Agent 等你在电脑上操作时，做完点底栏的「我完成了」，它就接着做。直接关掉画面也算交还。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When an agent needs you, the left side always switches to a highlighted count. When another app also has a Live Activity, the Dynamic Island leaves Persona only a small slot that shows the count of the most urgent kind (Needs you > Working > Unread), whatever the style above." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When an agent needs you, the left side always switches to a highlighted count. When another app also has a Live Activity, the Dynamic Island leaves Persona only a small slot that shows the count of the most urgent kind (Needs you > Working > Unread), whatever the style above."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "エージェントが要対応のときは、左側が常に強調色の件数に切り替わります。ほかのアプリにもライブアクティビティがある場合、Dynamic IslandはPersonaに小さな領域しか残さないため、最も急ぎの種類の件数だけを表示します（要対応 > 作業中 > 未確認）。上のスタイルには影響されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有 Agent 需要你时，左侧总是换成强调色的数量。别的 App 也有实时活动时，灵动岛只留给 Persona 一小块，只显示最急的一类的数量（需要你 > 在工作 > 做完未看），不受上面的样式影响。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When an extension from these markets has a new version, the hub installs it while the extension is idle, and asks you first if it wants more permissions. You can turn this off for each extension on its own page." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When an extension from these markets has a new version, the hub installs it while the extension is idle, and asks you first if it wants more permissions. You can turn this off for each extension on its own page."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "これらのマーケットからの拡張機能に新しいバージョンが出ると、拡張機能がアイドルのときにハブが自動でインストールします。必要な権限が増える場合は先に確認します。拡張機能ごとにそのページでオフにすることもできます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "从这些市场装的扩展出了新版本，扩展空闲时 hub 自动装上；要的权限变多时先问你。每个扩展也可以在自己的页面里单独关掉。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When botmux is installed on this computer, its sessions are listed along with the selected engine's. Turn this off to stop listing them and stop running botmux." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When botmux is installed on this computer, its sessions are listed along with the selected engine's. Turn this off to stop listing them and stop running botmux."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このコンピューターにbotmuxがある場合、botmuxのセッションを選択したエンジンのセッションと一緒に表示します。オフにすると表示せず、botmuxも実行しません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台电脑装了 botmux 时，botmux 里的会话和所选引擎的会话一起列出。关掉后不再列出，也不再运行 botmux。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When it happened; now when empty" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When it happened; now when empty"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "起きた時刻。空なら現在"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发生的时间；留空就是现在"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it's locked, verify once and the saved password is typed on its lock screen" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When it's locked, verify once and the saved password is typed on its lock screen"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ロック時に認証すると、保存したパスワードをロック画面に入力します"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "锁屏时验证一下，就把记住的密码输入它的锁屏"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When it's off, %@ is no longer read. Your sign-in and the data already saved are kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When it's off, %1$@ is no longer read. Your sign-in and the data already saved are kept."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにすると%1$@の読み込みを停止します。ログイン状態と保存済みのデータは残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关掉后不再读 %1$@；登录状态和已经存下的数据都留着。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When it's off, %@ stops. Your sign-in is kept." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When it's off, %1$@ stops. Your sign-in is kept."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにすると%1$@は停止します。ログイン状態は残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关掉后 %1$@ 停下来；登录状态留着。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When off, it stops passing messages to Persona; the binding and settings stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, it stops passing messages to Persona; the binding and settings stay."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにするとPersonaにメッセージを渡さなくなります。紐づけと設定は残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关掉后它不再把消息交给 Persona；绑定和设置留着。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When off, it stops running and the connectors and other things it provides turn off too; its settings and secrets stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, it stops running and the connectors and other things it provides turn off too; its settings and secrets stay."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにすると実行されなくなり、提供するコネクタなども一緒にオフになります。設定とシークレットは残ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "停用后它不再运行，提供的连接器等也一起关掉；设置和密钥留着。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When off, the Lock Screen shows only counts and “A permission is waiting”, not agent names or content" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, the Lock Screen shows only counts and “A permission is waiting”, not agent names or content"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフのとき、ロック画面には件数と「許可を待っています」だけを表示し、エージェント名や内容は表示しません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关着时锁屏只显示数量和「有个授权等你」，不显示 Agent 名字和内容"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When off, the app connects to the hub directly first and only uses the SSH tunnel if that fails. The tunnel is rebuilt when the iPhone app returns to the foreground." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, the app connects to the hub directly first and only uses the SSH tunnel if that fails. The tunnel is rebuilt when the iPhone app returns to the foreground."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフのときはまずハブに直接接続し、つながらない場合だけSSHトンネルを使います。iPhoneでアプリがフォアグラウンドに戻るとトンネルを再確立します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时先直连 hub，连不上才走 SSH 隧道。iPhone 回到前台时隧道会重新建立。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When off, the app connects to the hub directly first and only uses the SSH tunnel if that fails. The tunnel retries automatically after it disconnects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, the app connects to the hub directly first and only uses the SSH tunnel if that fails. The tunnel retries automatically after it disconnects."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフのときはまずハブに直接接続し、つながらない場合だけSSHトンネルを使います。トンネルが切断されると自動で再試行します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时先直连 hub，连不上才走 SSH 隧道。隧道断开后会自动重试。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When off, the app connects to the hub directly first and only uses the proxy if that fails, then checks every 2 minutes whether the direct connection works again. Only Persona's traffic to the hub goes through the proxy." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, the app connects to the hub directly first and only uses the proxy if that fails, then checks every 2 minutes whether the direct connection works again. Only Persona's traffic to the hub goes through the proxy."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフのときはまずハブに直接接続し、つながらない場合だけプロキシを使います。その後は2分ごとに直接接続が戻ったかを確認します。プロキシを通るのはPersonaからハブへの通信だけです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时先直连 hub，连不上才走代理，之后每 2 分钟检查一次直连是否恢复。只有 Persona 连 hub 的流量经过代理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, the hub is tried directly first and the tunnel is used only if that fails. Only Persona's traffic to the hub goes through it; other apps aren't affected. The tunnel disconnects when Persona goes to the background and reconnects when it comes back." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, the hub is tried directly first and the tunnel is used only if that fails. Only Persona's traffic to the hub goes through it; other apps aren't affected. The tunnel disconnects when Persona goes to the background and reconnects when it comes back."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフのときはまず hub に直接接続し、つながらない場合だけトンネルを使います。トンネルを通るのは Persona から hub への通信だけで、ほかのアプリには影響しません。Persona がバックグラウンドに入るとトンネルは切断され、フォアグラウンドに戻ると再接続します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭时先直连 hub，连不上才走隧道。只有 Persona 连 hub 的流量经过它，其他 App 不受影响；Persona 进后台时隧道断开，回到前台再连上。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When off, this device gets no notifications from this assistant" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, this device gets no notifications from this assistant"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにすると、このデバイスはこのアシスタントからの通知を受け取りません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关掉后，这台设备不再收到这个助手的推送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When off, this extension’s capabilities are unavailable. Your configuration is kept." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When off, this extension’s capabilities are unavailable. Your configuration is kept."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关闭后，此扩展的功能不可用，配置会保留。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オフにするとこの拡張機能の機能は利用できなくなります。設定は保持されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When on, Persona sends a request only right after you speak, so an agent’s results read aloud can’t give instructions for you. Turn it off if it keeps holding back your own requests." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, Persona sends a request only right after you speak, so an agent’s results read aloud can’t give instructions for you. Turn it off if it keeps holding back your own requests."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンにすると、Persona はあなたが話した直後にだけ依頼を送信するので、読み上げたエージェントの結果があなたに代わって指示を出すことはありません。自分の依頼が何度も保留されるときはオフにしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开时，Persona 只在你刚说完话后才发送请求，这样朗读出来的 Agent 结果就无法替你下指令。如果它总是拦下你自己的请求，可以把它关掉。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When on, new versions install themselves once the assistant and all agents are idle, and you get a notification afterward." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, new versions install themselves once the assistant and all agents are idle, and you get a notification afterward."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンにすると、新しいバージョンはアシスタントとすべてのエージェントがアイドルのときに自動でインストールされ、完了後に通知が届きます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开着时，有新版本就在助手和所有 Agent 都空闲时自己装上，装完推一条通知。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When on, the Claude Code sessions Persona starts on this computer send their replies while Claude writes them, so this app and the web show the text sooner. The cost: in this computer's terminal, replies appear a few lines at a time instead of word by word. The hub keeps this switch, not ~/.claude/settings.json; with “Apply to All Online Machines” on above, the other online computers change too. A change applies to sessions started after it; a session that is already running changes once Claude restarts." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When on, the Claude Code sessions Persona starts on this computer send their replies while Claude writes them, so this app and the web show the text sooner. The cost: in this computer's terminal, replies appear a few lines at a time instead of word by word. The hub keeps this switch, not ~/.claude/settings.json; with “Apply to All Online Machines” on above, the other online computers change too. A change applies to sessions started after it; a session that is already running changes once Claude restarts."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンにすると、Persona がこのコンピューターで起動した Claude Code セッションは Claude が書いている途中の返信を送るため、このアプリと Web で文字を早く確認できます。代わりに、このコンピューターのターミナルでは返信が一語ずつではなく数行ずつ表示されます。この設定はハブに保存され、~/.claude/settings.json は変更しません。上の「オンラインのすべてのマシンに適用」がオンのときは、ほかのオンラインのコンピューターも一緒に変わります。変更はその後に起動したセッションに適用され、実行中のセッションは Claude を再起動すると切り替わります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开着时，Persona 在这台电脑上启动的 Claude Code 会话会边写边把回复发出来，App 和网页上更早看到文字；代价是这台电脑终端里的回复会按行显示（一次几行），而不是逐字出现。这个开关存在 hub 上，不改 ~/.claude/settings.json；打开上面的「同时改所有在线机器」时，其他在线的电脑也一起改。改动对之后启动的会话生效，已经开着的会话要等 Claude 重启后才变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When tasks from the main chat finish, wait for you or get interrupted, they're combined into one card sent to Lark, with stages and links" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When tasks from the main chat finish, wait for you or get interrupted, they're combined into one card sent to Lark, with stages and links"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "メインチャットから依頼したタスクが完了・待機・中断したとき、複数件を1枚のカードにまとめてLarkに送ります（ステージとリンク付き）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "主对话派出的任务做完、在等你、被打断时，几条合成一张卡片发到飞书，带阶段和链接"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When the Mac has more than one display, choose one in “…” › Displays to show only that display. Zooming, taps and the pointer then stay on it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the Mac has more than one display, choose one in “…” › Displays to show only that display. Zooming, taps and the pointer then stay on it."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Macに複数のディスプレイがあるときは、「…」›「ディスプレイ」で1台を選ぶと、そのディスプレイだけを表示します。拡大、タップ、ポインタもそのディスプレイの中に限られます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Mac 有多块显示器时，在「…」›「显示器」里选一块，就只显示那一块。缩放、点按和指针也只在这块显示器上。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When the market has a new version, it installs while the extension is idle, and asks you first if it wants more permissions. If it doesn't start after installing, it goes back to the previous version." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the market has a new version, it installs while the extension is idle, and asks you first if it wants more permissions. If it doesn't start after installing, it goes back to the previous version."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "マーケットに新しいバージョンが出ると、拡張機能がアイドルのときに自動でインストールします。必要な権限が増える場合は先に確認します。インストール後に起動しない場合は元のバージョンに戻します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "扩展市场里出了新版本，扩展空闲时自动装上；新版本要的权限变多时先问你。装上后起不来的会退回原来的版本。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When the terminal opens, the iPhone takes it over: the computer's pane takes the iPhone's rows and columns, and Claude lays out to the iPhone's width. When you leave the terminal, the app goes to the background, or the connection drops, the pane returns to the computer's size." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the terminal opens, the iPhone takes it over: the computer's pane takes the iPhone's rows and columns, and Claude lays out to the iPhone's width. When you leave the terminal, the app goes to the background, or the connection drops, the pane returns to the computer's size."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ターミナルを開くとiPhoneが引き継ぎます。コンピューター上のペインはiPhoneの行数・列数になり、ClaudeはiPhoneの幅でレイアウトします。ターミナルを離れるか、Appがバックグラウンドに移るか、接続が切れると、ペインはコンピューターのサイズに戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开终端时由手机接管：电脑上的窗格变成手机的行列数，Claude 按手机宽度排版；离开终端、App 进后台或断线后，窗格回到电脑上的尺寸。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When the terminal opens, this window takes it over: the computer's pane takes the window's rows and columns, and Claude lays out to the window's width. When you leave the terminal or the connection drops, the pane returns to the computer's size." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the terminal opens, this window takes it over: the computer's pane takes the window's rows and columns, and Claude lays out to the window's width. When you leave the terminal or the connection drops, the pane returns to the computer's size."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ターミナルを開くとこのウインドウが引き継ぎます。コンピューター上のペインはウインドウの行数・列数になり、Claudeはウインドウの幅でレイアウトします。ターミナルを離れるか接続が切れると、ペインはコンピューターのサイズに戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开终端时由这个窗口接管：电脑上的窗格变成窗口的行列数，Claude 按窗口宽度排版；离开终端或断线后，窗格回到电脑上的尺寸。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When this Mac is locked, tap One-Tap Unlock and verify with %@ (or your passcode) to type the saved login password on its lock screen. Once unlocked it won't lock again by itself; tap Lock when you're done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When this Mac is locked, tap One-Tap Unlock and verify with %1$@ (or your passcode) to type the saved login password on its lock screen. Once unlocked it won't lock again by itself; tap Lock when you're done."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このMacがロックされているときに「ワンタップでロック解除」をタップして%1$@（またはパスコード）で認証すると、保存したログインパスワードをロック画面に入力します。解除後は自動ではロックされないため、使い終わったら「ロック」をタップしてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台 Mac 锁屏时，点「一键解锁」并验证%1$@（或设备密码），就把记住的登录密码输入它的锁屏。解开后它不会自己再锁上，用完点「锁上」。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "When this task runs, it won't ask before running any command, changing any file or using any tool, and no one can stop it midway. Use it only for prompts you trust and whose mistakes you can live with." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When this task runs, it won't ask before running any command, changing any file or using any tool, and no one can stop it midway. Use it only for prompts you trust and whose mistakes you can live with."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "このタスクの実行中は、コマンドの実行、ファイルの変更、ツールの使用をすべて確認なしで行い、途中で止めることもできません。信頼でき、失敗しても問題ないプロンプトにだけ使ってください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个任务运行时，跑任何命令、改任何文件、用任何工具都不再问你，也没有人能中途拦下。只给你信得过、出了错也能接受的提示词用。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
