    "While driving, clicks, drags and right and middle clicks go to the program on the computer (only programs with mouse support, like vim or Claude Code, receive them). Hold Shift to select text and open the menu here; ⌘-click still opens links." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While driving, clicks, drags and right and middle clicks go to the program on the computer (only programs with mouse support, like vim or Claude Code, receive them). Hold Shift to select text and open the menu here; ⌘-click still opens links."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "操作中はクリック、ドラッグ、右クリック、中クリックをコンピューター上のプログラムに渡します（vimやClaude Codeなどマウス対応のプログラムのみ受け取れます）。Shiftを押しながらここで文字を選択し、右クリックでメニューを開けます。⌘クリックでリンクは通常どおり開きます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接管时点击、拖动、右键和中键都交给电脑上的程序（vim、Claude Code 这类开了鼠标的程序才收得到），按住 Shift 在这里选字、右键出菜单；⌘ 点链接照旧打开。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "While driving, select text and right-click for the menu here; a single click still clicks the program. Hold Shift to hand the mouse to the program." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While driving, select text and right-click for the menu here; a single click still clicks the program. Hold Shift to hand the mouse to the program."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "操作中はここで文字を選択し、右クリックでメニューを開きます。シングルクリックは通常どおりプログラムをクリックします。Shiftを押している間だけマウスをプログラムに渡します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接管时在这里选字、右键出菜单，单击照旧是点一下程序；按住 Shift 才把鼠标交给程序。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "While idle" : {
      "comment" : "How a compaction started",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While idle"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アイドル時"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "空闲时"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "While the extension is on, this Mac won't lock when idle, so anyone sitting at it can use it. This turns itself off after 30 minutes without the hub." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While the extension is on, this Mac won't lock when idle, so anyone sitting at it can use it. This turns itself off after 30 minutes without the hub."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "オンにすると、拡張機能が有効な間このMacはアイドル時にロックされず、前に座った人がそのまま使えます。ハブとの接続が30分切れると自動的に元に戻ります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开后这台 Mac 在扩展开着时一直不会因为空闲锁屏，坐在它前面的人能直接用它。和 hub 断开 30 分钟后自动恢复。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "While you're using a computer with Persona Link, this iPhone stops sending “Needs you” notifications and Persona Link shows them there. “Agent done” and reminders you asked Persona to set still come to this iPhone. Lock each of these computers or quit Persona Link on it, and this iPhone sends “Needs you” again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While you're using a computer with Persona Link, this iPhone stops sending “Needs you” notifications and Persona Link shows them there. “Agent done” and reminders you asked Persona to set still come to this iPhone. Lock each of these computers or quit Persona Link on it, and this iPhone sends “Needs you” again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在装有 Persona Link 的电脑前使用时，这台 iPhone 不再推送「需要你处理」的通知，由 Persona Link 在电脑上提醒你；「Agent 做完」和你让 Persona 定的提醒照常推送到这台 iPhone。这些电脑都锁定或退出 Persona Link 后，这台 iPhone 才恢复推送「需要你处理」。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona Link が入ったコンピューターを使っている間、このiPhoneには「要対応」の通知が届かず、Persona Link がそのコンピューターで知らせます。「エージェント完了」とPersonaに設定を頼んだリマインダーは通常どおりこのiPhoneに届きます。これらのコンピューターをすべてロックするか、それぞれで Persona Link を終了すると、「要対応」は再びこのiPhoneに届きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you're using a computer with Persona Link, this iPhone stops sending “Needs you” notifications and Persona Link shows them there. “Agent done” and reminders you asked Persona to set still come to this iPhone. Lock that computer or quit Persona Link, and this iPhone sends “Needs you” again." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "While you're using a computer with Persona Link, this iPhone stops sending “Needs you” notifications and Persona Link shows them there. “Agent done” and reminders you asked Persona to set still come to this iPhone. Lock that computer or quit Persona Link, and this iPhone sends “Needs you” again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在装有 Persona Link 的电脑前使用时，这台 iPhone 不再推送「需要你处理」的通知，由 Persona Link 在电脑上提醒你；「Agent 做完」和你让 Persona 定的提醒照常推送到这台 iPhone。锁定那台电脑或退出 Persona Link 后，这台 iPhone 恢复推送「需要你处理」。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Persona Link が入ったコンピューターを使っている間、このiPhoneには「要対応」の通知が届かず、Persona Link がそのコンピューターで知らせます。「エージェント完了」とPersonaに設定を頼んだリマインダーは通常どおりこのiPhoneに届きます。そのコンピューターをロックするか Persona Link を終了すると、「要対応」は再びこのiPhoneに届きます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
