    "Without a token, GitHub allows only 60 reads an hour, shared by every device on your network. A GitHub token raises that to 5,000, public repos included (a fine-grained token with Public repositories and no permissions is enough)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Without a token, GitHub allows only 60 reads an hour, shared by every device on your network. A GitHub token raises that to 5,000, public repos included (a fine-grained token with Public repositories and no permissions is enough)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "トークンがないと、GitHubの読み取りは1時間あたり60回までで、同じネットワーク内のデバイスで共有されます。GitHubトークンを設定すると5,000回になり、公開リポジトリにも有効です（fine-grained tokenでPublic repositoriesを選び、権限は不要です）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "GitHub 不带 token 时每小时只能读 60 次，同一个网络里的设备共用这份额度。填一个 GitHub token 能到 5000 次，公开仓库也适用（fine-grained token 选 Public repositories，不用勾任何权限）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
