          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Write in the field below the terminal and press Return to send it all at once. The key bar's ctrl / alt / ⇧ also apply to the next character you type in the field." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write in the field below the terminal and press Return to send it all at once. The key bar's ctrl / alt / ⇧ also apply to the next character you type in the field."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ターミナルの下の入力欄に書いて、Returnでまとめて送信します。キーバーのctrl / alt / ⇧は入力欄で次に入力する文字にも効きます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在终端下方的输入框里写好，按回车一次发出去；键栏的 ctrl / alt / ⇧ 对输入框里打的下一个字也生效。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Write it as you would in a chat: what to look at and how to report. It can use schedule_followup to set up one-time follow-ups, like 10 minutes before a meeting." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Write it as you would in a chat: what to look at and how to report. It can use schedule_followup to set up one-time follow-ups, like 10 minutes before a meeting."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "チャットと同じように書きます。何を見て、どう報告するか。schedule_followupで1回きりのフォローアップ（会議の10分前など）も予約できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "像在对话里一样写：看哪些数据、怎么汇报。它可以用 schedule_followup 再安排一次性的跟进，比如会前 10 分钟。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
