          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "“%@”\\nYour message wasn’t sent so it wouldn’t merge with this text. Deal with it on the computer, then tap the exclamation mark next to your message to resend." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%1$@”\\nYour message wasn’t sent so it wouldn’t merge with this text. Deal with it on the computer, then tap the exclamation mark next to your message to resend."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%1$@」\\nこのテキストとつながらないよう、メッセージはまだ送信していません。コンピューター上でこのテキストを処理してから、メッセージ横の感嘆符をタップして再送してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%1$@」\n这条消息还没发，免得和它拼在一起。这段内容要在电脑上处理掉，再点消息旁的感叹号重发。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "“About Me” is what you tell Persona; “Memory” is what it notes down on its own in chats. You can edit both." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“About Me” is what you tell Persona; “Memory” is what it notes down on its own in chats. You can edit both."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「自分について」はあなたがPersonaに伝えた内容、「メモリ」はPersonaがチャット中に自分で記録した内容です。どちらも編集できます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「关于我」是你告诉 Persona 的；「记忆」是它在对话里自己记下的，都可以改。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "“Extension, last run” updates each time the Dynamic Island redraws (identical content is written at most once every ten minutes). If it's missing, the extension may not be able to use the App Group; then only the system log has its records (Console, subsystem persona, category island)." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Extension, last run” updates each time the Dynamic Island redraws (identical content is written at most once every ten minutes). If it's missing, the extension may not be able to use the App Group; then only the system log has its records (Console, subsystem persona, category island)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「拡張機能の前回の記録」はDynamic Islandが再描画されるたびに更新されます（同じ内容は最大10分に1回だけ書き込みます）。表示されない場合、拡張機能がApp Groupを使えない可能性があり、記録はシステムログにのみ残ります（コンソール、サブシステムpersona、カテゴリisland）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「扩展最近一次」在灵动岛每次重画后更新（同样的内容最多十分钟写一次）。看不到它时，扩展可能用不了 App Group，这时只有系统日志里有它的记录（控制台，子系统 persona，类别 island）。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "“Picture in Picture” in “…” floats the screen over other apps and the Home Screen; tap it to come back here. Picture in Picture is view-only, and closing it disconnects." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Picture in Picture” in “…” floats the screen over other apps and the Home Screen; tap it to come back here. Picture in Picture is view-only, and closing it disconnects."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「…」の「ピクチャ・イン・ピクチャ」で画面を小さなウインドウにして、ほかのAppやホーム画面の上に表示し続けます。タップするとここに戻ります。表示のみで、閉じると切断されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「…」里的「小窗」把画面放进画中画，切到别的 App 或回到桌面也浮着；点小窗回到这里。小窗只能看，关掉小窗就断开。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "“Status count” shows the most urgent kind on the left (Needs you > Working > Unread) and the next kind on the right." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“Status count” shows the most urgent kind on the left (Needs you > Working > Unread) and the next kind on the right."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「状態の件数」は、左側に最も急ぎの種類（要対応 > 作業中 > 未確認）、右側に次の種類を表示します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「状态数量」在左侧显示最急的一类（需要你 > 在工作 > 做完未看），在右侧显示下一类。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
