    "“%@” leaves the lists, search and the assistant's context. Its chats, people and documents stay; they just stop naming it. You can undo this right after." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“%1$@” leaves the lists, search and the assistant's context. Its chats, people and documents stay; they just stop naming it. You can undo this right after."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%1$@」会从列表、搜索和助手的上下文里移除。它关联的聊天、人和文档都还在，只是不再关联它。删除后可以马上撤销。"
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "「%1$@」は一覧、検索、アシスタントのコンテキストから外れます。関連するチャット、人、ドキュメントは残り、関連付けだけが外れます。削除直後なら元に戻せます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
